<title>USA: Arafat arrives in Washington for summit.</title>
<headline>Arafat arrives in Washington for summit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in the United States early on Tuesday for an emergency summit called to end an explosion of violence that has threatened to derail the Middle East peace process.</p>
<p>Israeli President Benjamin Netanyahu and Jordan's King Hussein will join Arafat at the hastily arranged two-day summit called by President Bill Clinton. Before leaving for the summit, Arafat told reporters in Luxembourg that he would attend with &quot;no conditions or ultimatums.&quot;</p>
</text>
